        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dive into a heart-pounding, turn-based clash of Dragons Versus Knight.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For seven generations the kingdom of Jappa has been plagued by the wretched Dragon Surge. Step into the boots of Stan the Knight, a fearless hero tasked with vanquishing four ruthless dragon clans to save the realm. Roll the mighty D20 to unleash devastating attacks, dodge deadly giant claw strikes and land critical hits that deal double the damage! But tread carefully for each dragon clan wields a catastrophic breath attack that could end your quest by turn 20. Time your health potions with precision to stay in the fight and outsmart your scaly foes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your tactical brilliance by choosing upgrade cards that power up your knight. But beware, every upgrade you claim makes the dragon clans even deadlier, raising the stakes for an epic showdown. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Triumph over the dragon hordes to unlock epic rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exclusive bonus features include</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soundtrack player</strong>: Relive DVK's epic soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dev gallery</strong>: Explore behind-the-scenes art and insights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All Upgrades Active mode</strong>: Replay DVK with maxed-out power!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go hence forth and destroyeth the dragon clans and save Jappa once and for all!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
